# POLARIS core

- Source of truth: `README_ARCHITECTURE.md`, `MASTER_CURSOR_PROMPT.md`, `AGENTS.md`.
- Canonical tree is the modular monolith (`apps/`, `platform/`, `domains/`, `hazards/`, `simulation/`). Do not add `packages/` or a top-level `sim/` engine.
- Evidence: DESIGNED is not IMPLEMENTED. Never fake features.
- Decision-support only. Human-in-the-loop. Not an official evacuation authority.
- No alerts without disclaimer + provenance.
- No mass-generated business code. Do not add CHI, live adapters, IoT, RF, Flutter UI, or Next apps unless explicitly asked. V1 flood (SIMULATED PHI/GCI/DRAFT + Horizon GeoJSON) and Mocoa 2017 HISTORICAL_REPLAY are already in tree.
- No secrets in git. Wokwi is not the Digital Testbed.
- This product is not Shopify Polaris.
